Flagging early: We are ready to begin substrate preparation ahead of the fl=
oor covering installation. Shot blasting is scheduled first, then patching =
at the two low areas the surveyor flagged, then in-situ probe testing per A=
STM F2170 before any adhesive goes down. We will forward the probe readings=
 and the manufacturer sign off before anything is set, and we will hold the=
 sequence if the readings come back outside the specified range. Copies are=
 in the project folder.